title Dynamic View: System\nA request with parallel lookups

actor <<Person>>\nUser as User
participant <<Container>>\nApp as App
participant <<Container>>\nStore as Store
participant <<Software System>>\nThird Party as Third Party

User->App: Sends a request
App->Store: Reads the record
App->Third Party: Looks up the rate
App->Store: Stores the rate
Store->App: Notifies of the change
App->Third Party: Confirms
